   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Paper Me\n\nYou as a paper cutout; then you slowly turn your head and smile. With a before/after reveal.\n\nFreeField preset `paper-me`. Runs on an 8 GB GPU. Open weights only.\n\n## Fill in\n- A clear photo of your face: the node **Your photo (preset input)**\n\n## Stages, left to right\n- 1\\. Your photo\n- 2\\. Transform (FLUX.2 klein 4B)\n- 3\\. Animate (Wan 2.2 TI2V-5B)\n- 4\\. Reveal (masked composition)\n- 5\\. Title card\n- Save\n\n## Models\n- `flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors`\n- `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors`\n- `flux2-vae.safetensors`\n- `Wan2_2-TI2V-5B-Turbo-Q6_K.gguf`\n- `umt5-xxl-encoder-Q5_K_M.gguf`\n- `wan2.2_vae.safetensors`\n\n## What happens\nThis graph makes the finished video.\n\n## Run it\n1. Install this workflow's files into ComfyUI's input folder: `python3 scripts/install_workflow_assets.py --url http://127.0.0.1:8188 paper-me`\n2. Pick your file in the input node above and press Run.\n\nOr run the whole effect in FreeField: `python -m freefield run paper-me --photo me.jpg`\n\nLicense: flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors apache-2.0; qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors apache-2.0; flux2-vae.safetensors apache-2.0; Wan2_2-TI2V-5B-Turbo-Q6_K.gguf apache-2.0; umt5-xxl-encoder-Q5_K_M.gguf apache-2.0; wan2.2_vae.safetensors apache-2.0\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# Paper Me\n\nYou as a paper cutout; then you slowly turn your head and smile. With a before/after reveal.\n\nFreeField preset `paper-me`. Runs on an 8 GB GPU. Open weights only.\n\n## Fill in\n- A clear photo of your face: the node **Your photo (preset input)**\n\n## Stages, left to right\n- 1\\. Your photo\n- 2\\. Transform (FLUX.2 klein 4B)\n- 3\\. Animate (Wan 2.2 TI2V-5B)\n- 4\\. Reveal (masked composition)\n- 5\\. Title card\n- Save\n\n## Models\n- `flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors`\n- `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors`\n- `flux2-vae.safetensors`\n- `Wan2_2-TI2V-5B-Turbo-Q6_K.gguf`\n- `umt5-xxl-encoder-Q5_K_M.gguf`\n- `wan2.2_vae.safetensors`\n\n## What happens\nThis graph makes the finished video.\n\n## Run it\n1. Install this workflow's files into ComfyUI's input folder: `python3 scripts/install_workflow_assets.py --url http://127.0.0.1:8188 paper-me`\n2. Pick your file in the input node above and press Run.\n\nOr run the whole effect in FreeField: `python -m freefield run paper-me --photo me.jpg`\n\nLicense: flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors apache-2.0; qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors apache-2.0; flux2-vae.safetensors apache-2.0; Wan2_2-TI2V-5B-Turbo-Q6_K.gguf apache-2.0; umt5-xxl-encoder-Q5_K_M.gguf apache-2.0; wan2.2_vae.safetensors apache-2.0\n"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
